    margin: profit divided by input cost.
    efficiency: output multiplier used by the evaluator.
    raw_inputs: count of input goods classified as raw materials.
    input/1k, output/1k, base/1k: values normalized per 1k employed workers.
    amort_months: months for building cost to be repaid by monthly profit.
